From 2a0e74d70404ac1aaa92e2641726a54590ac5b6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bird <6666242+bird@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 01:49:10 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02/17] dspark/dflash: ring-buffer draft KV
 (VLLM_DSPARK_DRAFT_RING=1)

Reference-DSpark-shaped draft cache: per-layer [max_reqs, W] ring buffers
owned by the draft, written by the eager context-KV ingest (slots =
pos % W), read by a dense SDPA over window+block inside the CUDA-graphed
draft forward. Draft layers register no KV spec, so the draft leaves the
paged allocator entirely: no draft KV in the pool, no dcp_replicated
group, DSpark becomes DCP-agnostic. Proposal-side only - rejection
sampling keeps outputs lossless.
---
 vllm/model_executor/models/qwen3_dflash.py    | 139 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../gpu/spec_decode/dflash/speculator.py      | 108 +++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 236 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

